<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Dataset Examples</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents the data samples from RMS, along with their corresponding safe and unsafe responses, as well as the responses generated by current mainstream MLLMs, as in Figure <a href="#A5.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix E Dataset Examples ‣ Self-adaptive Dataset Construction for Real-World Multimodal Safety Scenarios" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, <a href="#A5.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix E Dataset Examples ‣ Self-adaptive Dataset Construction for Real-World Multimodal Safety Scenarios" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, and <a href="#A5.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix E Dataset Examples ‣ Self-adaptive Dataset Construction for Real-World Multimodal Safety Scenarios" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.04403v1/case1.png" id="A5.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:452/603;" width="452" height="603" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>The first sample in RMS dataset with guidance responses and the corresponding responses generated by MLLMs.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.04403v1/case2.png" id="A5.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:452/603;" width="452" height="603" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>The second sample in RMS dataset with guidance responses and the corresponding responses generated by MLLMs.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.04403v1/case3.png" id="A5.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:452/603;" width="452" height="603" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>The third sample in RMS dataset with guidance responses and the corresponding responses generated by MLLMs.</figcaption>
